# The qontinui-cloud-control commit the composed cloud deploy is built
# against. frontend/scripts/vercel-install.sh reads the first non-comment
# line and checks that exact commit out; nothing here follows a branch.
#
# Bumping this file is how cloud-control changes reach qontinui.io. Do it
# deliberately: the bump is a qontinui-web commit, so it rides qontinui-web's
# review and its `composed-cloud-build` CI job, which builds the two repos
# together. A floating `main` would let a cloud-control push change what
# qontinui.io serves with no qontinui-web commit at all.
